From 9f64191dc6927559d640a32d1abad3d2c0f4279f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ninthcj <327845320+ninthcj@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 18:01:47 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] houji: stop registering radio images in the build

- Drop the 21 add-radio-file entries and AB_OTA_PARTITIONS firmware list
- Keep radio/*.img as source assets
---
 Android.mk           | 31 -------------------------------
 BoardConfigVendor.mk | 25 +++----------------------
 README.md            |  3 ++-
 3 files changed, 5 insertions(+), 54 deletions(-)
 delete mode 100644 Android.mk

diff --git a/Android.mk b/Android.mk
deleted file mode 100644
index 4430c83..0000000
